claramente del resto de especies del género Crambe por tener los frutos comprimidos dorsiventralmente y por tener las costillas laterales aladas. Otros caracteres diferenciales son sus hojas blanquecinas sin pelos. (Mesa, R. & R. Paredes, 2013)"},"pdf":true},"nivel":"insular","actualizado":"2026-11-21","gbifClave":5373522,"uicn":{"codigo":"CR","categoria":"En peligro crítico","nivel":"taxón","fuente":"Lista Roja de la UICN (versión 2022-2) vía GBIF","url":"https://www.gbif.org/species/5373522","iucnId":"162280"},"tamano":{"min":null,"max":1.0,"tipo":"altura","cita":"Arbusto de hasta 1m de alto","fuente":"Centinela (claves de identificación)","url":"https://www.biodiversidadcanarias.es/centinela/especie/F00927"},"ciclo":{"valor":"Perenne","fuente":"Centinela"},"forma":{"valor":"arbusto","fuente":"Centinela"},"fotosLibres":[{"fuente":"iNaturalist","url":"https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/107754361/medium.jpeg","autor":"Helder Santiago","lic":"CC BY-NC","licUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/deed.es","pagina":"https://www.inaturalist.org/photos/107754361","nivel":"taxon"},{"fuente":"iNaturalist","url":"https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/107754373/medium.jpeg","autor":"Helder Santiago","lic":"CC BY-NC","licUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/deed.es","pagina":"https://www.inaturalist.org/photos/107754373","nivel":"taxon"},{"fuente":"iNaturalist","url":"https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/107754370/medium.jpeg","autor":"Helder Santiago","lic":"CC BY-NC","licUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/deed.es","pagina":"https://www.inaturalist.org/photos/107754370","nivel":"taxon"}],"evc":{"url":"https://endemicascanarias.com/es/allcategories-es-es/endemicas/furteventura/crambe-sventenii","titulo":"Especies Vegetales en Canarias","autoria":"Gerardo G. Casanova y colaboradores"},"mundo":{"nativa":["Canarias"],"introducida":[],"nAreasNativa":1,"nAreasIntroducida":0,"fuente":